      "created_at": "2021-07-27T15:03:14.594Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the forums, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/coolman007\">@Coolman007</a>! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Greater Than Games (and all other small gaming companies) has really been significantly hurt by the global shipping issues. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"> (There are lots of articles / commentary on the topic out there, but <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbesbusinessdevelopmentcouncil/2021/05/25/how-the-shipping-container-crisis-demonstrates-the-risk-of-imbalance-in-global-trade/?sh=2056ba1a1090\">here’s a pretty comprehensive example</a>.) GTG has made public comments alluding to the fact they have a LOT of product that is just waiting its turn to start on its way. Until that happens, no one has games. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sob.png?v=9\" title=\":sob:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sob:\"></p>\n<p>Sorry for the bad news. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/pensive.png?v=9\" title=\":pensive:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pensive:\"> Don’t know if you’ve checked out <a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/spiritisland\">the digital version</a>, but that’s an option in the interim. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
